stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> unauthenticated
    unauthenticated --> authenticating: login-started
    authenticating --> authenticated: login-succeeded / guardar par en SecureStore
    authenticating --> unauthenticated: login-failed
    authenticating --> unauthenticated: logout

    authenticated --> expired: HTTP 401
    authenticated --> authenticating: login-started
    authenticated --> unauthenticated: logout / eliminar par seguro
    expired --> refreshing: refresh-started (single-flight)
    expired --> unauthenticated: refresh-failed / eliminar par seguro
    expired --> unauthenticated: logout / eliminar par seguro
    refreshing --> authenticated: refresh-succeeded / guardar par y reintentar una vez
    refreshing --> unauthenticated: refresh-failed / eliminar par seguro
    refreshing --> unauthenticated: logout / eliminar par seguro

    note right of refreshing
        El refresh usa el mismo fetch compartido.
        Sus errores no registran tokens.
    end note